      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Virtual Pet</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"style.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"game-board\">\n    <h1>Pixel Pet</h1>\n    <div class=\"pet-container\" aria-label=\"Your pixel pet\" role=\"img\">\n      <div class=\"pet\">\n        <div class=\"ear left\"></div>\n        <div class=\"ear right\"></div>\n        <div class=\"face\">\n          <div class=\"eye left\"></div>\n          <div class=\"eye right\"></div>\n          <div class=\"nose\"></div>\n          <div class=\"mouth\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <p id=\"mood-text\" class=\"mood\">Mood: Happy</p>\n    <div class=\"bars\">\n      <div class=\"bar-group\">\n        <label for=\"hunger-bar\">Hunger</label>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"hunger-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\">\n          <div class=\"fill hunger-fill\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-group\">\n        <label for=\"happiness-bar\">Happiness</label>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"happiness-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\">\n          <div class=\"fill happiness-fill\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"bar-group\">\n        <label for=\"energy-bar\">Energy</label>\n        <div class=\"bar\" id=\"energy-bar\" role=\"progressbar\" aria-valuemin=\"0\" aria-valuemax=\"100\" aria-valuenow=\"50\">\n          <div class=\"fill energy-fill\" style=\"width: 50%\"></div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"controls\">\n      <button id=\"feed-btn\" aria-label=\"Feed your pet\">Feed</button>\n      <button id=\"play-btn\" aria-label=\"Play with your pet\">Play</button>\n      <button id=\"sleep-btn\" aria-label=\"Put your pet to sleep\">Sleep</button>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with pet, bars, and controls"
    },
    {
      "path": "style.css",
      "content": "/* Palette: #2d1b2e (bg), #f5e6d3 (card), #6b4c3a (text), #e07a5f (accent), #3d5a80 (secondary) */\n* {\n  box-sizing: border-box;\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n}\n\nbody {\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: #2d1b2e;\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  color: #6b4c3a;\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.game-board {\n  background: #f5e6d3;\n  border-radius: 24px;\n  padding: 32px 24px;\n  max-width: 420px;\n  width: 100%;\n  text-align: center;\n  box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n}\n\nh1 {\n  font-size: 28px;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n  color: #3d5a80;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\n.pet-container {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  margin-bottom: 16px;\n}\n\n.pet {\n  position: relative;\n  width: 120px;\n  height: 120px;\n  background: #e07a5f;\n  border-radius: 16px;\n  image-rendering: pixelated;\n  box-shadow: inset -4px -4px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n}\n\n.ear {\n  position: absolute;\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 24px;\n  background: #e07a5f;\n  top: -12px;\n  border-radius: 4px;\n  box-shadow: inset -2px -2px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);\n}\n\n.ear.left {\n  left: 16px;\n  transform: rotate(-15deg);\n}\n\n.ear.right {\n  right: 16px;\n  transform: rotate(15deg);\n}\n\n.face {\n  position: absolute;\n  inset: 0;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 8px;\n}\n\n.eye {\n  width: 16px;\n  height: 16px;\n  background: #2d1b2e;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  position: absolute;\n  top: 36px;\n}\n\n.eye.left {\n  left: 28px;\n}\n\n.eye.right {\n  right: 28px;\n}\n\n.nose {\n  width: 12px;\n  height: 8px;\n  background: #2d1b2e;\n  border-radius: 50%;\n  margin-top: 8px;\n}\n\n.mouth {\n  width: 24px;\n  height: 12px;\n  border-bottom: 3px solid #2d1b2e;\n  border-radius: 0 0 50% 50%;\n  margin-top: -4px;\n}\n\n.mood {\n  font-size: 18px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\n  min-height: 1.4em;\n  color: #3d5a80;\n}\n\n.bars {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 12px;\n  margin-bottom: 24px;\n  text-align: left;\n}\n\n.bar-group label {\n  font-size: 14px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  display: block;\n  margin-bottom: 4px;\n}\n\n.bar {\n  height: 20px;\n  background: #d9c9b6;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  overflow: hidden;\n}\n\n.fill {\n  height: 100%;\n  border-radius: 10px;\n  transition: width 0.3s ease;\n}\n\n.hunger-fill {\n  background: #e07a5f;\n}\n\n.happiness-fill {\n  background: #3d5a80;\n}\n\n.energy-fill {\n  background: #81b29a;\n}\n\n.controls {\n  display: flex;\n  gap: 12px;\n  justify-content: center;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font-family: inherit;\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  padding: 12px 24px;\n  border: none;\n  border-radius: 12px;\n  background: #3d5a80;\n  color: #f5e6d3;\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.2s, transform 0.1s;\n  min-width: 80px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover {\n  background: #2d4a66;\n}\n\nbutton:focus-visible {\n  outline: 3px solid #e07a5f;\n  outline-offset: 2px;\n}\n\nbutton:active {\n  transform: scale(0.95);\n  background: #1e3a52;\n}\n\nbutton:disabled {\n  opacity: 0.5;\n  cursor: not-allowed;\n}\n\n@media (max-width: 400px) {\n  .game-board {\n    padding: 24px 16px;\n  }\n  h1 {\n    font-size: 24px;\n  }\n  button {\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    min-width: 70px;\n  }\n}",
      "description": "Styles for pixel pet, bars, buttons, and responsive layout"
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "// State\nconst state = {\n  hunger: 50,\n  happiness: 50,\n  energy: 50\n};\n\n// DOM elements\nconst hungerBar = document.getElementById('hunger-bar');\nconst happinessBar = document.getElementById('happiness-bar');\nconst energyBar = document.getElementById('energy-bar');\nconst moodText = document.getElementById('mood-text');\nconst feedBtn = document.getElementById('feed-btn');\nconst playBtn = document.getElementById('play-btn');\nconst sleepBtn = document.getElementById('sleep-btn');\n\n// Update UI\nfunction updateUI() {\n  hungerBar.querySelector('.fill').style.width = state.hunger + '%';\n  hungerBar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', state.hunger);\n  happinessBar.querySelector('.fill').style.width = state.happiness + '%';\n  happinessBar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', state.happiness);\n  energyBar.querySelector('.fill').style.width = state.energy + '%';\n  energyBar.setAttribute('aria-valuenow', state.energy);\n\n  // Mood logic: based on average of the three stats\n  const avg = (state.hunger + state.happiness + state.energy) / 3;\n  if (avg >= 80) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Mood: Ecstatic! 🎉';\n  } else if (avg >= 60) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Mood: Happy 😊';\n  } else if (avg >= 40) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Mood: Okay 😐';\n  } else if (avg >= 20) {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Mood: Sad 😢';\n  } else {\n    moodText.textContent = 'Mood: Critical! 😫';\n  }\n}\n\n// Clamp helper\nfunction clamp(val) {\n  return Math.max(0, Math.min(100, val));\n}\n\n// Actions\nfeedBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger + 20);\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness + 5);\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy - 5);\n  updateUI();\n});\n\nplayBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness + 20);\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger - 10);\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy - 15);\n  updateUI();\n});\n\nsleepBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {\n  state.energy = clamp(state.energy + 25);\n  state.hunger = clamp(state.hunger - 10);\n  state.happiness = clamp(state.happiness - 5);\n  updateUI();\n});\n\n// Initial render\nupdateUI();",
      "description": "State management, event listeners, and mood logic"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Virtual Pet\n\nA CSS-drawn pixel creature with hunger, happiness, and energy bars. Feed, Play, and Sleep buttons change the bars, and the mood text updates dynamically.\n\n## Features\n\n- **Pixel pet**: Drawn entirely with CSS (no images).\n- **Three status bars**: Hunger, Happiness, Energy (0–100).\n- **Interactive buttons**: Feed, Play, Sleep — each modifies the bars.\n- **Dynamic mood text**: Updates based on the average of the three stats.\n- **Accessible**: Keyboard-focusable buttons with visible focus states, ARIA labels, and progressbar roles.\n- **Responsive**: Works from 360px wide.\n- **Offline**: No external dependencies, network requests, or packages.\n\n## How to Run\n\nOpen `index.html` in any modern browser. No server required.\n\n## Controls\n\n- **Feed**: +20 Hunger, +5 Happiness, −5 Energy\n- **Play**: +20 Happiness, −10 Hunger, −15 Energy\n- **Sleep**: +25 Energy, −10 Hunger, −5 Happiness\n\nAll values are clamped between 0 and 100.\n\n## Mood Logic\n\nMood is based on the average of the three stats:\n- ≥80: Ecstatic\n- ≥60: Happy\n- ≥40: Okay\n- ≥20: Sad\n- <20: Critical\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — Structure and content\n- `style.css` — Pixel art, layout, and theming\n- `script.js` — State management and event handling\n\n## Palette\n\n- Background: `#2d1b2e`\n- Card: `#f5e6d3`\n- Text: `#6b4c3a`\n- Accent: `#e07a5f`\n- Secondary: `#3d5a80`\n\n## License\n\nMIT",
      "description": ""
    }
